## ⚙️ Core Configuration Snippets

Below are standard configuration syntax examples applied throughout the project implementation:

### 1. Inter-VLAN Sub-Interface Setup 
```ios
interface GigabitEthernet0/0.10
 encapsulation dot1Q 10
 ip address 192.168.1.1 255.255.255.0
exit

interface GigabitEthernet0/0.20
 encapsulation dot1Q 20
 ip address 192.168.2.1 255.255.255.0
exit
```

### 2. Router-Based DHCP Pool Setup
```ios
service dhcp

ip dhcp pool Admin_Pool
 network 192.168.1.0 255.255.255.0
 default-router 192.168.1.1
 dns-server 192.168.1.1
exit

ip dhcp pool HR_Pool
 network 192.168.2.0 255.255.255.0
 default-router 192.168.2.1
 dns-server 192.168.2.1
exit
```

### 3. Multi-Layer Switch Trunking Port Setup
```ios
interface GigabitEthernet1/0/1
 switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
 switchport mode trunk
exit
```

### 4. RIPv2 Dynamic Routing Domain Configuration
```ios
router rip
 version 2
 network 10.0.0.0
 network 192.168.1.0
 network 192.168.2.0
 [Advertise all corresponding subnet links]
 no auto-summary
exit
```
